The Inspector window of the Browser panel is Chrome's DevTools frontend (https://github.com/ChromeDevTools/devtools-frontend),
built without changes at the revision pinned in scripts/devtools-frontend.json. A release carries it in
app/public/devtools-frontend, with LICENSES.txt beside it holding the licence text of DevTools and of each package it bundles:
acorn, codemirror.next and third-party-web (MIT); csp_evaluator, diff, legacy-javascript, lighthouse, puppeteer,
puppeteer-replay, wasmparser and web-vitals (Apache-2.0); intl-messageformat, lit, marked (also MIT) and
source-map-scopes-codec (BSD-3-Clause).

